{
  "_about": "Report EC complaint taxonomy. Parent categories come from the Member 6 brief. Subcategories are ours. 'legacy_category' is the value used by the current dashboard and reports table (water_leak, no_water, power_outage, pothole, streetlight, other) so the two can work together until the database team decides on the final list. 'base_priority' is the starting point before context is considered (null = not enough information to suggest one).",
